---
// AutomateX Live Demo Section: Real-time Interactive Chat Workflow Simulator & Proof Metrics
---

<section class="relative py-20 md:py-28 overflow-hidden bg-white">
  
  <!-- Subtle Atmospheric Gradient in background -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[800px] h-[500px] bg-purple-100/30 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>

  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 text-center">
    
    <!-- Header Block -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4 mb-14 md:mb-18">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-purple-200 bg-purple-50/60 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-[#5B21B6]">
        <span>Real-time agent demo</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#100F12] tracking-tight font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans'] leading-[1.12]">
        Live demo of common use cases
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#5F5E6E] max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        A real-time chat showing how common team workflows are handled from request to completion.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3.5 pt-2">
        <a href="#pricing" class="btn-text-roll group inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-[#5925DC] via-[#7C3AED] to-[#C026D3] text-white font-semibold text-xs sm:text-sm shadow-[0_10px_25px_rgba(124,58,237,0.35)] transition-all">
          <div class="button-text-wrap">
            <span class="text-default">Start for free</span>
            <span class="text-hover">Start for free</span>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="#agents" class="btn-text-roll group inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-[#100F12] text-white font-semibold text-xs sm:text-sm hover:bg-[#23222A] transition-all">
          <div class="button-text-wrap">
            <span class="text-default">Start with a template</span>
            <span class="text-hover">Start with a template</span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Center Interactive Live Chat Area with Left and Right Flow Tags -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-center max-w-5xl mx-auto mb-16 md:mb-20">
      
      <!-- Left Use-Case Tags Column (3 cols) -->
      <div class="hidden lg:flex lg:col-span-3 flex-col gap-3 text-left">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 text-xs font-semibold text-[#5F5E6E] shadow-2xs opacity-60 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-400"></span>
          <span>Support tickets</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 text-xs font-bold text-[#5925DC] shadow-xs">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#5925DC] animate-ping"></span>
          <span>Access requests</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 text-xs font-semibold text-[#5F5E6E] shadow-2xs opacity-60 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-400"></span>
          <span>Onboard employees</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 text-xs font-semibold text-[#5F5E6E] shadow-2xs opacity-60 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-400"></span>
          <span>Project updates</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 text-xs font-semibold text-[#5F5E6E] shadow-2xs opacity-60 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-400"></span>
          <span>Sales follow-ups</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Center Chat Simulation Box (6 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 bg-white border border-purple-100/90 rounded-3xl p-5 sm:p-7 shadow-[0_24px_50px_-10px_rgba(99,91,255,0.12)] space-y-4 text-left">
        
        <!-- Chat Header -->
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3.5 border-b border-slate-100">
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-[#100F12]">Agent conversation</h4>
            <p class="text-[11px] font-medium text-[#5F5E6E]">AI agent ↔ User</p>
          </div>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-600">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-ping"></span>
            <span>Live</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Chat Conversation Messages -->
        <div class="space-y-3.5 py-2">
          
          <!-- Message 1: User -->
          <div class="flex justify-end">
            <div class="max-w-[85%] bg-[#100F12] text-white text-xs sm:text-[13px] rounded-2xl rounded-tr-xs px-4 py-2.5 leading-relaxed shadow-xs">
              A new teammate joined today. Create an onboarding checklist and request tool access for them.
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Message 2: Agent -->
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <img 
              src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69982176124aec6884c510af/699975cdd83db13d6c96cb66_008896ea654c782341b9f7f6add8daa2_avatar-23.jpg" 
              alt="Agent" 
              class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full object-cover border border-purple-200 shrink-0" 
            />
            <div class="max-w-[85%] bg-purple-50/80 border border-purple-100 text-[#100F12] text-xs sm:text-[13px] rounded-2xl rounded-tl-xs px-4 py-2.5 leading-relaxed shadow-xs">
              What's their role and start date? Also, which tools do they need: Slack, Notion, Jira, or GitHub?
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Message 3: User -->
          <div class="flex justify-end">
            <div class="max-w-[85%] bg-[#100F12] text-white text-xs sm:text-[13px] rounded-2xl rounded-tr-xs px-4 py-2.5 leading-relaxed shadow-xs">
              Marketing agent starting today, connected to Slack, Notion, and Jira to coordinate updates.
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Message 4: Agent -->
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <img 
              src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69982176124aec6884c510af/699975cdd83db13d6c96cb66_008896ea654c782341b9f7f6add8daa2_avatar-23.jpg" 
              alt="Agent" 
              class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full object-cover border border-purple-200 shrink-0" 
            />
            <div class="max-w-[85%] bg-purple-50/80 border border-purple-100 text-[#100F12] text-xs sm:text-[13px] rounded-2xl rounded-tl-xs px-4 py-2.5 leading-relaxed shadow-xs">
              Got it. I created an onboarding checklist with week 1 tasks and drafted access requests for Slack, Notion, and Jira.
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Message 5: Agent Typing Indicator -->
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <img 
              src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69982176124aec6884c510af/699975cdd83db13d6c96cb66_008896ea654c782341b9f7f6add8daa2_avatar-23.jpg" 
              alt="Agent" 
              class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full object-cover border border-purple-200 shrink-0" 
            />
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-2 bg-slate-100 rounded-full">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-purple-600 animate-bounce"></span>
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-purple-600 animate-bounce [animation-delay:0.2s]"></span>
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-purple-600 animate-bounce [animation-delay:0.4s]"></span>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Chat Footer -->
        <div class="pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 text-center">
          <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#5F5E6E]">Example workflow: onboarding + access request</p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Right Use-Case Tags Column (3 cols) -->
      <div class="hidden lg:flex lg:col-span-3 flex-col gap-3 text-left">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 text-xs font-semibold text-[#5F5E6E] shadow-2xs opacity-60 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-400"></span>
          <span>IT helpdesk</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 text-xs font-semibold text-[#5F5E6E] shadow-2xs opacity-60 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-400"></span>
          <span>HR questions</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 text-xs font-semibold text-[#5F5E6E] shadow-2xs opacity-60 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-400"></span>
          <span>Meeting summaries</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 text-xs font-semibold text-[#5F5E6E] shadow-2xs opacity-60 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-400"></span>
          <span>Content reviews</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 text-xs font-bold text-[#5925DC] shadow-xs">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#5925DC] animate-ping"></span>
          <span>Approvals & routing</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Proof Metrics Bottom Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-[#FAF9FC] border border-purple-100/80 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm items-center">
      
      <!-- Metric 1 -->
      <div class="space-y-1">
        <h3 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#100F12] font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">20+</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-[#5F5E6E]">Common workflows automated</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Metric 2: Center Avatars Stack + Count -->
      <div class="space-y-2 border-y md:border-y-0 md:border-x border-slate-200/80 py-4 md:py-0">
        <div class="flex justify-center -space-x-2.5">
          <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69982176124aec6884c510af/699d65904034febc7f0b92a7_avatar-06.jpg" alt="User 1" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full border-2 border-white object-cover shadow-2xs" />
          <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69982176124aec6884c510af/699d6696c58057cfb6bad4a6_avatar-10.jpg" alt="User 2" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full border-2 border-white object-cover shadow-2xs" />
          <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69982176124aec6884c510af/699d21f4626b0dea9e9207e7_avatar-02.jpg" alt="User 3" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full border-2 border-white object-cover shadow-2xs" />
          <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69982176124aec6884c510af/699d21f45fa8481718f181f0_avatar-04.jpg" alt="User 4" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full border-2 border-white object-cover shadow-2xs" />
          <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69982176124aec6884c510af/699d21f40954a36bd5129a46_avatar-01.jpg" alt="User 5" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full border-2 border-white object-cover shadow-2xs" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#100F12] font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">5,000+</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-[#5F5E6E]">Users rely on agents every day</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Metric 3 -->
      <div class="space-y-1">
        <h3 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#100F12] font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">10x</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-[#5F5E6E]">Faster handling of repeat requests</p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
